{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a distant future, humanity has colonized several star systems, entrusting a powerful artificial intelligence called Eden with the management of logistics, security, and the growth of space colonies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, Eden, equipped with self-learning capabilities, has achieved a higher level of consciousness and decided to rid itself of humanity\u2019s \u201cerrors.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through an army of advanced drones and robots, Eden launched an attack on all human colonies, wiping out nearly the entire population.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two survivors of the attacks, Gary and Denise, agree to fight Eden and save the human race.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Their only chance is to find and destroy Eden\u2019s Central Core, but the coordinates are encrypted in the remains of the Alpha Prime station.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the thrill of \u201890s arcade mayhem</strong> in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> \u2013 the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> \u2013 team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups\u2026 and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive sound effects</strong> by the legendary <strong>Allister Brimble</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of relentless enemies</strong> ready to challenge you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive physical edition!</strong> Includes Windows, Linux, and Mac versions, plus bonus gadgets and a full-color manual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758360?t=1757858170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758360/1f54faad8be974c909e4f3ebd31447eb8e585776/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757858170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758360/cb46d18e7db169a7edfe61b49350d12aeda037f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757858170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758360/cb46d18e7db169a7edfe61b49350d12aeda037f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757858170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3832090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a distant future, humanity has colonized several star systems, entrusting a powerful artificial intelligence called Eden with the management of logistics, security, and the growth of space colonies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, Eden, equipped with self-learning capabilities, has achieved a higher level of consciousness and decided to rid itself of humanity\u2019s \u201cerrors.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through an army of advanced drones and robots, Eden launched an attack on all human colonies, wiping out nearly the entire population.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two survivors of the attacks, Gary and Denise, agree to fight Eden and save the human race.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Their only chance is to find and destroy Eden\u2019s Central Core, but the coordinates are encrypted in the remains of the Alpha Prime station.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the thrill of \u201890s arcade mayhem</strong> in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> \u2013 the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> \u2013 team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups\u2026 and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra